# Chapter 1 "Night One": game-flow glue for the greybox.
#
# The story's words live in c1_script.dlg, generated from docs/CHAPTER_1_SCRIPT.md by
# tools/script_to_dlg.py. This file only sequences those nodes ("~ call c1_script#NODE"),
# adds the cinematic beats (vanishing, lights, audio, cards, fights) and a few short
# PLACEHOLDER lines where the greybox needs words the script does not have yet.
# Scenes not greyboxed yet: S02 upstairs, S10 basement, S11 stranger, S12 before dawn.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- House, evening

== cold_open
~ call c1_script#C1_S00.lines
~ call c1_script#C1_S01.lines
~ set C1_T01

== kitchen_enter
~ call c1_script#C1_S03.lines
~ set C1_T02
~ toast Set the table: plates (cupboard), forks (drawer), iced tea (fridge).

== mom
~ if C1_LAST_WORDS -> mom_bye
~ if C1_ERRAND -> mom_errand
~ if !C1_T02 -> kitchen_enter
# PLACEHOLDER
mom(happy): Plates, forks, iced tea. The table won't set itself, Picasso.

== mom_errand
# PLACEHOLDER
mom: Card's on the hook by the front door. Milk, bread, nine-volt.

== mom_bye
~ call c1_script#C1_S03b_L040

== cupboard
~ call c1_script#C1_OBJ_CUPBOARD
~ if !C1_T02 | table_plates end
~ set table_plates
-> check_table

== fork_drawer
~ call c1_script#C1_OBJ_FORK_DRAWER
~ if !C1_T02 | table_forks end
~ set table_forks
~ call c1_script#C1_S03_L010.single
~ call c1_script#C1_S03_L011.single
~ call c1_script#C1_S03_L012.single
-> check_table

== fridge
~ call c1_script#C1_OBJ_FRIDGE
~ if !C1_T02 | table_tea end
~ set table_tea
~ call c1_script#C1_S03_L013.single
-> check_table

== check_table
~ if table_plates & table_forks & table_tea -> dinner
~ toast Keep setting the table.

== dinner
~ set table_set
~ call c1_script#C1_S03.dialogue
~ call c1_script#C1_S03.choices
~ call c1_script#C1_S03.choices_2
~ set C1_ERRAND
~ toast New task: take Mom's card from the hook by the front door.

== key_hook
~ call c1_script#C1_OBJ_KEY_HOOK
~ give mom_card
~ give tote_bag
~ give house_key
~ set took_card

== at_the_door
~ call c1_script#C1_S03b.lines
~ call c1_script#C1_S03b.choices
~ toast New task: milk, bread and a 9-volt battery at Ridge Corner Market (east end of the street).

== front_door_locked
# PLACEHOLDER
{vanished} hero: Not without knowing where she is.
{!vanished & !C1_ERRAND} hero: Dinner first. Mom would kill me.
{!vanished & C1_ERRAND & !took_card} hero: Mom's card. It's on the hook by the door.
{!vanished & took_card} hero: Mom's still talking. Say goodbye first.

== radio
~ if C1_DAWN -> broadcast
~ call c1_script#C1_OBJ_RADIO_KITCHEN

== stove
~ call c1_script#C1_OBJ_STOVE_NIGHT

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Linden Court, dusk

== street_dusk
# PLACEHOLDER
hero: Ridge Corner Market. East end of the street. Milk, bread, nine-volt.

== walt
~ if vanished -> walt_bark
~ call c1_script#C1_S04.walt

== okoros
~ call c1_script#C1_S04.okoros

== noah
~ call c1_script#C1_S04.noah

== erik
~ if vanished -> erik_bark
~ call c1_script#C1_S04.noah

== ines
~ set calm_success
~ call c1_script#C1_S04.ines_and_biscuit

== look_up
~ call c1_script#C1_OBJ_SKY

== home_blocked
# PLACEHOLDER
hero: Not with him out here. I'm not leading him to Mom.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Ridge Corner Market

== store_enter
~ sfx store_door_chime
~ call c1_script#C1_S05.lines
~ set hollis_greeted

== hollis
~ if has:milk & has:bread & has:battery_9v -> checkout
# PLACEHOLDER
hollis(happy): Milk's in the back cooler, bread by the window, batteries on the hook. Take your time.

== took_battery
~ call c1_script#C1_OBJ_STORE_BATTERY_HOOK
~ set C1_HAS_BATTERY true

== wade_busy
~ call c1_script#C1_S05_L010.single

# THE MOMENT (script C1_S05_MOMENT): the line stops mid-word, Hollis is simply gone,
# four seconds of total silence, then the world breaks.
== checkout
~ call c1_script#C1_S05.checkout
~ vanish hollis
~ mute_all
~ wait 4
~ close_box
~ unmute_all
~ music_stop 0
~ ambience_clear 0
~ sfx car_crash
~ shake 6 0.8
~ sfx power_cut
~ lights store off 1.4
~ ambient #262634 1.2
~ wait 0.6
~ ambience car_alarm_loop -10 0.5
~ sfx scream_distant
~ ambience drone_tension_loop -8 3
~ wait 1.0
~ set vanished
~ sfx phone_buzz
~ call c1_script#C1_S05_MOMENT.lines
~ checkpoint
-> wade

== wade
~ unset C1_NEXT
~ call c1_script#C1_S06.lines
~ call c1_script#C1_S06.choices
~ if C1_NEXT == COMBAT_C1_WADE -> wade_fight
~ set wade_gone
~ hide wade

== wade_fight
~ set wade_hostile
~ music chaos 0.5
~ toast Attack: J / (X).  Dodge: Space / (B).  A mop handle leans by the wet-floor sign.

== wade_beaten
~ call c1_script#COMBAT_C1_WADE.win_lines
~ set wade_gone
~ set item_available ITEM_BOX_CUTTER
~ music_stop 2
~ checkpoint

== took_mop
# PLACEHOLDER
hero: Better than nothing.
~ equip mop_handle

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- The street, after

== street_chaos
~ call c1_script#C1_S07.lines_entry
~ toast Get home to Mom (west end of the street).

== walt_bark
~ call c1_script#C1_S07_L014.single
~ call c1_script#C1_S07_L015.single

== erik_bark
~ call c1_script#C1_S07_L010.single
~ call c1_script#C1_S07_L011.single

== noah_clothes
# PLACEHOLDER
hero: Noah's shirt. His shorts. His shoes, laces still tied.

== found_bat
# PLACEHOLDER
hero: Somebody's Little League bat. Better than my hands.
~ equip bat

# PLACEHOLDER: the script has no street looter yet (Wade is the store looter). The brief asks
# for a looter fight on the street, so a nameless one stands between the store and home.
== street_looter
looter(angry): Back off! This is mine now. All of it.
hero: I just want to get home.
looter(angry): Then you should've stayed there.
~ toast Attack: J / (X).  Dodge: Space / (B).  Hold Shift to run.

== street_looter_beaten
hero(afraid): ...
hero: Keep moving. Home.

== biscuit
~ unset C1_NEXT
~ call c1_script#C1_S07a.lines
~ call c1_script#C1_S07a.choices
~ if C1_NEXT == CALM_MINIGAME -> biscuit_calm
~ if C1_NEXT == BACKYARD_ROUTE -> biscuit_around
~ set biscuit_gone

# The calm minigame is not built yet: meeting Mrs. Albright earlier makes it succeed.
== biscuit_calm
~ if C1_MET_INES -> biscuit_befriended
# PLACEHOLDER
hero: Easy... easy, buddy...
~ sfx dog_growl
~ set C1_BISCUIT scared_off
~ set biscuit_hostile
~ toast He's terrified. He snaps!

== biscuit_befriended
~ call c1_script#C1_S07a.success_lines
~ set C1_BISCUIT befriended

== biscuit_around
~ set C1_BISCUIT avoided
~ toast You go the long way, through the backyards.

== biscuit_bolted
# PLACEHOLDER
hero: ...Sorry, buddy. Go home. Go find her.

== biscuit_friend
# PLACEHOLDER
hero: Stay close, Biscuit.

== dana
~ if dana_resolved -> wreck_after
~ unset C1_NEXT
~ call c1_script#C1_S07b.lines
~ call c1_script#C1_S07b.choices
~ set dana_resolved
~ if C1_NEXT == RESCUE_DANA -> rescue_dana

# The rescue sequence is not built yet; it plays as a short beat.
== rescue_dana
~ call c1_script#RESCUE_DANA.lines
~ shake 3 0.5
~ sfx glass_break
~ wait 0.8
~ call c1_script#RESCUE_DANA.success_lines

== wreck_after
# PLACEHOLDER (from the script's direction)
examine[The Okoros' SUV]: The driver's seat is empty. Felix's seatbelt is still buckled across nothing.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Home, Mom gone

== home_empty
~ call c1_script#C1_S08.entry_lines
~ set C1_T06
~ toast Find Mom.

== mom_chair
~ call c1_script#C1_OBJ_MOM_CHAIR
~ if saw_chair end
~ set saw_chair
~ call c1_script#C1_S08.fixed_shot_lines

== bible_and_letter
~ call c1_script#C1_OBJ_BIBLE_OPEN
~ give letter
~ music_stop 1.5
~ call c1_script#C1_S09.enter
~ call c1_script#C1_S09.pages
~ call c1_script#C1_S09.after_letter
~ set C1_READ_LETTER
~ card timeskip "Hours later." "6:02 AM. The power is out."
~ set C1_DAWN
~ lights house off 0.1
~ lights dawn on 0.1
~ ambient #a89cb0 0.1
~ vignette 0.5 0.1
~ ambience_clear 0.5
~ ambience dawn_quiet_loop
~ checkpoint
# PLACEHOLDER
hero: Mom's radio. Battery-powered. "In case."
~ toast Turn on the radio on the kitchen windowsill.

== read_bible
examine[Mom's Bible]: Open to First Thessalonians, chapter four. Her red pen, everywhere.
~ call c1_script#C1_S13.optional_read

== broadcast
~ sfx emergency_broadcast_tone
~ call c1_script#C1_S13.station_1_emergency
~ call c1_script#C1_S13.station_2_ridge_radio
~ call c1_script#C1_S13.station_3_far_station
~ call c1_script#C1_S13.feed_murmur
~ call c1_script#C1_S13.end_lines
~ music dawn_hope 2
~ call c1_script#C1_S13.optional_read
~ set chapter1_complete
~ card timeskip "Of the people who vanished, no one came back." "Of the people who stayed, everyone had a theory."
~ card chapter "Chapter 2" "Three months later..."
~ end_chapter 2
